blocks.en:
The observed sequence interleaves {K} latent sources while preserving
word order inside each source. Reconstruct {K} source token arrays from the {T} observed
tokens. index\ttoken {indexed_json_tokens}

blocks.zh:
观测到的序列在保留 {K} 潜在源时会互出
每个源的词序。 重建 {K} 从 {T} 观测到的源代码数组
符号。 索引\ ttoken { indexed_ json_tokens}

blocks.en:
The observed sequence contains {T} indexed word occurrences from {K} latent sources. Partition all occurrences into exactly {K} non-empty source token arrays. Copy each token string exactly once
across the arrays. Do not add, delete, duplicate, correct, merge, split, or
paraphrase any token. Preserve increasing input-index order within each source. index\ttoken {indexed_json_tokens}

blocks.zh:
观测到的序列包含{T} 来自{K}潜在来源的已索引的单词事件 。 将所有事件分割到 {K} 非空源符数组 。 复制每个字串一次
横跨数组。 不添加、删除、复制、更正、合并、拆分或
将任何符号都译为。 在每个来源内保留越来越多的输入-索引顺序. 索引\ ttoken { indexed_json_tokens}

blocks.en:
The adapted conditions in Table 3 average three models;
the frozen conditions use the same unadapted checkpoint. All conditions use the
same batch-one evaluation setting as the MultiNLI EPoR row.

blocks.zh:
表3中的调整条件平均为三种模式;
冻结的条件使用同样的未经调整的检查站。 所有条件都使用
与多NLI EPOR行相同的批次一评价设置.
